# Normalize line endings in the repository regardless of the author's OS/editor
# settings (Windows editors/tools default to CRLF, macOS/Linux to LF) - git
# converts to LF on stage/commit and checks files out as LF on every platform,
# so `git diff` never shows a file as fully rewritten just from a CRLF/LF swap.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Diffs/merges on these binary-ish vendor assets are meaningless; skip them
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
